---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro"; import {concepts,patterns} from "../../data/knowledge";
const types=[{title:"Primers",copy:"Focused prerequisite bridges with a clear enough-to-begin threshold.",href:"/learn/primers/",count:11},{title:"Concepts",copy:"What a production mechanism is and what it does not guarantee.",href:"/learn/concepts/",count:concepts.length},{title:"Patterns",copy:"When to apply a reusable engineering decision, and its tradeoffs.",href:"/learn/patterns/",count:patterns.length},{title:"Reference systems",copy:"How production architectures assemble the mechanisms.",href:"/learn/systems/",count:5},{title:"Field cases",copy:"Evidence-backed lessons from real operating contexts.",href:"/learn/case-studies/",count:5}];
---
<Base title="Learn FDE Engineering | FDE Commons" description="Understand the production engineering, customer judgment, and system mechanisms required for forward-deployed work." pageSlug="learn"><div class="shell learn"><header><p class="eyebrow">LEARN</p><h1>What do I need to understand to do FDE work well?</h1><p>Begin with your path. Go deeper by skill, specialization, and depth. The content types are tools, not competing destinations.</p></header><section class="depth"><article><span>5 MIN</span><h2>Understand</h2><p>Plain-English mental model.</p></article><article><span>20 MIN</span><h2>Apply</h2><p>Architecture, example, and choices.</p></article><article><span>60 MIN</span><h2>Engineer</h2><p>Implementation and failure modes.</p></article><article><span>HANDS-ON</span><h2>Prove</h2><p>Lab, evidence, and Field Report.</p></article></section><section><p class="eyebrow">CANONICAL CONTENT</p><div class="types">{types.map(t=><a href={t.href}><span>{t.count}</span><h2>{t.title}</h2><p>{t.copy}</p><b>Explore →</b></a>)}</div></section><section class="flagship"><div><p class="eyebrow">FLAGSHIP COURSE 001</p><h2>Engineering Long-Running AI Agents</h2><p>Situation → problem → primitive → mechanism → build → failure → tradeoff → prove.</p><a class="btn btn--solid" href="/learn/courses/long-running-agents/">Open Course 001 →</a></div><ol><li>BUILD</li><li>BREAK</li><li>DIAGNOSE</li><li>FIX</li><li>PROVE</li></ol></section><section class="flagship flagship--alt"><div><p class="eyebrow">FLAGSHIP COURSE 002</p><h2>Agentic AI System Design</h2><p>Requirements → authority → topology → tools → context → durable state → security → evals → operations.</p><a class="btn btn--solid" href="/learn/courses/agentic-system-design/">Open Course 002 →</a></div><ol><li>LEARN</li><li>SHIP</li><li>RUN</li><li>DESIGN</li><li>DEFEND</li></ol></section></div></Base>
<style>.learn{max-width:1150px}.learn header{padding:7rem 0}.learn header h1{font-size:clamp(2.25rem,8vw,7rem);max-width:15ch;overflow-wrap:break-word}.learn header>p:last-child{color:var(--fg-muted);max-width:60ch}.learn>section{padding:5rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.depth{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border:1px solid var(--line)}.types{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);border:1px solid var(--line)}.depth article,.types a{padding:1rem;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.depth span,.types span{font:500 .62rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent)}.depth p,.types p{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--fg-muted)}.types a{color:var(--fg);min-height:14rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.types a:hover{text-decoration:none;background:#fff1e6}.types b{margin-top:auto;color:var(--accent);font:500 .65rem var(--font-mono)}.flagship{background:#18181b;color:white;margin-inline:calc(50% - 50vw);padding-inline:max(var(--pad),calc((100vw - 1150px)/2 + var(--pad)))!important;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5rem}.flagship h2{color:white;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,5rem)}.flagship ol{list-style:none;color:#ed8a59;font:500 .75rem var(--font-mono)}.flagship li{border-top:1px solid #39393f;padding:.6rem}.flagship--alt{background:var(--bg-raise);color:var(--fg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.flagship--alt h2{color:var(--fg)}.flagship--alt ol{color:var(--accent)}.flagship--alt li{border-top-color:var(--line)}@media(max-width:700px){.depth,.types{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.flagship{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
